4, "unit_id": "ADD-03:p4-image/th-notice", "words": "مهلة الإشعار المسبق"}, {"doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "span", "page": 1, "unit_id": "ADD-03:2.4", "words": "the maximum transfer flow stated for that tie-in point in Table 1-3."}], "id": "ADD-03/p4-issue-transfer-flow", "model_rationale": "The b06 band crops and the full region image show a single heading row of six grey cells, running from نقطة الربط on the right to مهلة الإشعار المسبق on the left, with no flow column (m3/h, l/s or similar). The page-4 image also shows TP-2 duration ٤ against 6 in the English translation (statement S6), which is for the batch that answers tp2-duration.", "payload": {"short": "Table 1-3 states no maximum transfer flow", "text": "The governing Arabic Table 1-3 has six columns (tie-in point, location, existing line diameter, permitted shutdown window, maximum shutdown duration, advance notice) and none gives a maximum transfer flow. ADD-03:2.4 (and Q20) require the method (a) temporary works to pass 'the maximum transfer flow stated for that tie-in point in Table 1-3'. That design flow is therefore not stated anywhere in the table.", "theme": "tie-in points"}, "provision": "ADD-03:p4-image/th-point", "state": {"activity_templates_sha256": "8f720c1d04e5f6d1926872e7bdeca2e28537782912cdc237796e2fe98e30d005", "amendments_sha256": "cec31d3931c953f5505c6db86b1f5b1b73e8b52e3817b7c29c409ea616489cca", "assumptions_sha256": "be5a1ecc966dab8d311cb4688827e56b9cd41f28053de21b5fb262fea446b1e0", "curation_sha256": "2cdf3faa6c1aed208a7e7fc24b6ca69c8a329fe41ffd4faa409c2cc5cc6c93b6", "decisions_sha256": null, "evidence_build_id": "f826cdeb7fbc262e1674323070670587be772af004e2a8855ab00b9209fb5848", "pack_id": "NUPA-ISTP-2026-014+ADD-03-CANDIDATE", "readings_sha256": "16b1b63f693c0dbd0db29c29700dae71525df534d9f300373aa0fd3b5d292bbf", "register_sha256": "8fa0072209651dfb94d0862e5cac287415c02ac8c85d7e02f0404990aa647ff5", "relationships_sha256": "1e6f35c25cd34a8718fff3d6ac2a8ce8b86821e3211c270742a64caa9b4c3052"