3:p4-image/th-point", "words": "نقطة الربط"}, {"crop_sha256": "ac054b8c3e2f21b89b4c8966b277f32aba161864a6e271f4167aeb1b55c53315", "doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "reading", "page": 4, "unit_id": "ADD-03:p4-image/th-notice", "words": "مهلة الإشعار المسبق"}, {"crop_sha256": "7058ab6013a3607a393bcb95a87fc93a5130e66515b97649b7321c2cf3cbb2dd", "doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "reading", "page": 4, "unit_id": "ADD-03:p4-image/tp1-point", "words": "TP-1"}], "id": "S3", "kind": "fact", "text": "The image on ADD-03 page 4 (region ADD-03-p4-r1) prints a ruled Arabic table with six heading cells, read right to left: نقطة الربط | الموقع | قطر الخط القائم (مم) | فترة الإيقاف المسموح بها | أقصى مدّة للإيقاف (ساعة) | مهلة الإشعار المسبق. A horizontal rule separates the heading row from the first body row, which starts with TP-1. The readings of these blocks are still pending."}, {"id": "S4", "kind": "interpretation", "text": "The heading cells, the heading rule and the TP-1 identifier are content of the table that ADD-03:2.1 incorporates. They print no change instruction, obligation or exception of their own. Any effect they have comes through 2.1 (and 2.2 to 2.7), which are answered in other batches, so each of these blocks has no separate amending effect."}, {"evidence": [{"doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "span", "page": 1, "unit_id": "ADD-03:2.4", "words": "the maximum transfer flow stated for that tie-in point in Table 1-3."}, {"crop_sha256": "ac054b8c3e2f21b89b4c8966b277f32aba161864a6e271f4167aeb1b55c53315", "doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "reading", "page": 4, "unit_id": "ADD-03:p4-image/th-duration", "words": "أقصى مدّة للإيقاف (ساعة)"}], "id": "S5", "kind": "fact", "text": "The Arabic heading row has no column for a maximum transfer flow. ADD-03:2.4 nevertheless refers to 'the maximum transfer flow stated for that tie-in point in Table 1-3'."}, {"evidence": [{"doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "reading", "page": 4, "unit_id": "ADD-03:p4-image/tp2-duration", "words": "٤"}], "id": "S6", "kind": "fact", "text": "Outside this batch, for information: the Arabic TP-2 maximum shutdown duration cell prints ٤, while the English translation row ADD-03:T1-3/tp-2 gives 6. Arabic note 1 also names the Eid al-Fitr and Eid al-Adha holidays, which English note (1) omits. Per 2.2 the Arabic governs."}]}, "run_id": "ADD-03-host-20261005T175926Z-56be", "ts": "2026-10-05T17:59:26Z"}
